	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"在&6创造：Forge Frontier&r中，模组&5Apotheosis&r重做了原版附魔系统。它通过为附魔台引入新属性，并用新书架来改变这些属性来实现。"
				""
				"这些统计数据如下所示："
				"&n&aEterna&r&r"
				"&n&4量子&r&r"
				"&5&n秘术&r&r"
				""
				"可以添加的其他修饰符有："
				"&e纠正&r"
				"&3附魔线索&r"
				"&6宝藏附魔&r"
			]
			id: "6965F4ABCAB88875"
			rewards: [{
				id: "48F1F245E472FD1F"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 150
			}]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 2.3d
			subtitle: "Apotheosis 附魔台"
			tasks: [{
				id: "2D29A403707CC3C6"
				item: "minecraft:book"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "附魔入门指南"
			x: 5.0d
			y: -7.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6965F4ABCAB88875"]
			description: [
				"&n&5Apotheosis&r&r 对 Minecraft 的附魔系统进行了重大改动，但一些核心机制仍然很熟悉。"
				""
				"附魔台只会检测与其属性修改器方块距离恰好为一个方块远的方块。这些属性会直接影响附魔的行为。"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&a&nEterna&r&r，也称为附魔之力，决定了你附魔的等级。不同等级和类型的书架会添加不同的数值。每种书架都有一个最大值上限，超过该上限，同类型的书架将不再增加数值。"
				""
				"你的附魔等级是你的 Eterna 值的 2 倍。如果你达到最大值 50 &n&aEterna&r&r，你的附魔等级将达到 100。"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&n&4Quanta&r&r represents the instability of your enchantments. It can be both beneficial and detrimental, as it may increase or decrease the true level applied. "
				""
				"增减的幅度取决于附魔台的 Quanta 值。如果附魔台的 Quanta 值为 50，实际的附魔值可能是 -50 或 +50。"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&n&5Arcana&r&r 是决定稀有附魔可用性的属性。数值越高，越容易获得稀有附魔。"
				""
				"然而，过高的&5&nArcana&r&r水平也会使普通附魔更难获得。"
			]
			id: "2172A6251E7C57A8"
			rewards: [
				{
					exclude_from_claim_all: true
					id: "299E61F0BA970F83"
					table_id: 8678092705658131358L
					type: "choice"
				}
				{
					id: "6931E7D726999DAB"
					type: "xp_levels"
					xp_levels: 2
				}
				{
					count: 10
					id: "08F6E0B772C8A4BA"
					item: "minecraft:bookshelf"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			subtitle: "附魔属性"
			tasks: [{
				id: "62E466E5012D5CCC"
				item: "minecraft:enchanting_table"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Apotheosis 附魔台"
			x: 5.0d
			y: -4.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2172A6251E7C57A8"]
			description: [
				"&n&eRectification&r&r 是一个与 &4&nQuanta&r&r 相互作用的修饰器。"
				""
				"It interacts by stripping away the negative side of the random modifier. &4&nQuanta&r&r can both increase and decrease the applied enchantment level, but the higher the Rectification, the smaller the possible decrease. "
				""
				"在100% &n&eRectification&r&r下，附魔等级永远不会低于基础值。相反，&4&nQuanta&r&r只能提升强度，甚至在与50 &a&nEterna&r&r配合使用时，等级可以超过100。"
			]
			icon: "apotheosis:rectifier"
